OL,3,AWoman killed in Times Square stabbing,
OL,4,Asuspect shot dead by police
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew York Police Department (NYPD)
OL,7,FCommissioner Jessica Tisch called the
OL,8,Fattack "an unprovoked double stabbing"
OL,9,Fwhich took place within approximately
OL,10,F20 seconds of each other.
